WEBVTT

00:15.500 --> 00:18.030
E-Enemy attack!

00:20.650 --> 00:22.730
E-Enemy attack!

00:25.080 --> 00:27.290
What's wrong? What's happening?

00:27.880 --> 00:29.980
Sir, I'll go see immediately!

00:31.730 --> 00:32.790
So he's here.

00:33.720 --> 00:35.840
Protect the gate and the walls!

00:35.840 --> 00:38.550
Don't let them inside the walls!

00:40.870 --> 00:42.140
What's that sound?

00:42.140 --> 00:43.600
What's going on?

02:21.490 --> 02:26.000
<i>General E Rudle</i>

02:27.300 --> 02:28.360
What's the situation?

02:28.360 --> 02:30.960
We've lost part of the walls, but not much else.

02:31.440 --> 02:32.700
How many are there?

02:32.700 --> 02:34.930
A few over 500, at most.

02:34.930 --> 02:37.040
We'll annihilate them immediately.

02:37.040 --> 02:38.610
These are demons.

02:39.130 --> 02:40.380
Be careful.

02:40.380 --> 02:40.930
Of course...

02:41.310 --> 02:43.030
Gather all our forces!

02:43.030 --> 02:43.780
Yes, sir!

03:08.160 --> 03:11.540
We'll draw the enemy's 
attention until Cefiro-sama

03:11.540 --> 03:13.410
and the wounded can escape the castle.

03:14.220 --> 03:17.130
Just endure until then. 
No matter what happens.

03:29.670 --> 03:31.140
Cease fire!

03:31.380 --> 03:32.660
Cease fire!

03:32.750 --> 03:34.100
Cease fire!

03:38.200 --> 03:40.660
This is too easy.

03:40.660 --> 03:44.540
If we attack with our main forces, 
it should be easy to crush them.

03:44.540 --> 03:46.860
I'd rather not fight a night 
battle against demons.

03:47.470 --> 03:49.260
We'll take losses, too.

03:49.260 --> 03:49.660
Yes, sir.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.980
<i>This is strange, though.</i>

03:52.460 --> 03:54.930
<i>They should be trying to 
rescue the prisoners.</i>

03:54.930 --> 03:56.630
<i>But they're barely moving.</i>

03:57.230 --> 04:00.230
<i>Their force is too small 
to penetrate our lines.</i>

04:00.230 --> 04:03.050
<i>And they don't have enough magic 
to put up a multi-layered defense.</i>

04:03.880 --> 04:06.800
<i>Their commander is probably...</i>

04:07.510 --> 04:10.040
I'm sure if I killed you then,

04:10.040 --> 04:13.480
I wouldn't find myself humiliated like this.

04:14.230 --> 04:17.620
I've heard that one of 
your men is very talented.

04:19.710 --> 04:23.580
I'm sure he won't leave you like this.

04:25.050 --> 04:27.950
Ike, the commander of the Undying Brigade.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.720
What's going on with the 
prisoner in the basement?

04:30.720 --> 04:33.280
We have her securely guarded, sir.

04:33.280 --> 04:35.090
Just in case, call Valtel.

04:35.090 --> 04:35.790
Yes, sir.

04:37.700 --> 04:40.930
<i>He's said to be the 
Demon Lord's strongest magician.</i>

04:42.460 --> 04:45.600
<i>I can't wait to see what he does.</i>

04:47.350 --> 04:49.980
Don't worry. I'll watch her carefully.

04:49.980 --> 04:51.780
Yes, thank you.

04:51.780 --> 04:54.080
Tell the general I said I'd do this.

04:54.080 --> 04:55.800
Understood. Thank you.

05:00.860 --> 05:03.740
Your buddies are outside the walls.

05:03.740 --> 05:09.360
Well, I can't imagine that a demon 
would care for one of their fellows.

05:09.360 --> 05:14.370
You know, you look just like a human.

05:16.040 --> 05:19.860
I wonder how a demon woman tastes.

05:19.860 --> 05:21.710
Like poison, I'm sure.

05:26.180 --> 05:27.740
Scum.

05:28.180 --> 05:29.890
Go to hell.

05:38.830 --> 05:42.640
I apologize for making you wait, Cefiro-sama.

05:48.000 --> 05:50.530
They aren't moving. Are they on to us?

05:50.780 --> 05:52.510
Is it time, Ike-dono?

05:52.510 --> 05:53.990
We're ready to go at any time!

05:53.990 --> 05:57.190
Gunther-sama! Just a little more!

05:57.190 --> 05:58.990
It's not time yet.

06:01.380 --> 06:02.540
I've got no choice.

06:08.290 --> 06:09.890
Another attack!

06:11.020 --> 06:12.260
They never learn.

06:12.750 --> 06:14.710
What's the status of our forces?

06:15.220 --> 06:19.000
Our light infantry units, our archers, 
and our light cavalry...

06:19.000 --> 06:20.850
are all ready to attack!

06:21.360 --> 06:24.820
Excellent. I'm sure they 
won't advance any further.

06:25.150 --> 06:27.810
Prepare our catapults and siege crossbows!

06:27.810 --> 06:30.220
Focus on fighting a battle of attrition!

06:30.220 --> 06:33.030
We'll attack when they're worn 
down and annihilate them!

06:33.030 --> 06:35.040
I'll give the order when the time's right.

06:35.040 --> 06:35.990
Yes, sir!

06:45.760 --> 06:47.270
It's started again.

06:47.270 --> 06:49.010
They're going all out.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.750
It would be bad if they 
got inside the castle.

06:51.750 --> 06:53.970
Wouldn't it be safer to kill them now?

06:57.700 --> 06:59.080
What's this?

07:00.890 --> 07:03.400
I feel weak...

07:09.070 --> 07:10.900
Too easy.

07:10.900 --> 07:13.030
The plan's going perfectly.

07:13.030 --> 07:14.760
Cefiro-sama!

07:15.990 --> 07:18.950
Okay, guys, time to...

07:17.590 --> 07:21.170
Cefiro-sama, I'm so glad you're safe.

07:21.920 --> 07:25.380
I'm sorry for worrying you, Fiorentina.

07:25.700 --> 07:27.820
I am unworthy of such words.

07:27.820 --> 07:30.830
If anything, I'm sorry I couldn't save you.

07:30.830 --> 07:31.390
Don't say that.

07:31.390 --> 07:34.840
Um, could you two do this later?

07:34.840 --> 07:37.100
We're on a tight schedule.

07:37.520 --> 07:40.550
Got it. I'll leave this to you.

07:40.550 --> 07:41.100
Now...

07:55.900 --> 07:57.990
Did you think you could get away?

07:58.730 --> 08:01.210
I won't let a single one of you escape!

08:01.210 --> 08:04.330
E Rudle knows your whole plan!

08:04.330 --> 08:06.920
If you're angry, blame your own foolishness!

08:06.920 --> 08:08.540
Now, kill them all.

08:12.400 --> 08:14.890
It really happened just like Ike-sama said!

08:14.890 --> 08:15.550
What?

08:15.800 --> 08:19.200
Time to regret being born a dumbass.

08:24.100 --> 08:26.130
Wh-Who are you?

08:26.130 --> 08:28.190
Where'd you come from?

08:28.450 --> 08:30.590
I'm a demon, as you can see.

08:30.590 --> 08:32.230
And how'd I get here?

08:32.230 --> 08:34.440
I walked, of course.

08:34.440 --> 08:36.680
Right through those crumbled castle walls.

08:36.680 --> 08:39.910
I did use a trick or two, though.

08:40.320 --> 08:41.370
A trick?!

08:44.010 --> 08:44.620
So it's time?

08:54.270 --> 08:55.130
Those weapons...

08:55.130 --> 08:57.470
First row, fire!

08:58.930 --> 09:01.310
Second row, fire!

09:03.020 --> 09:05.480
Third row, fire!

09:08.370 --> 09:10.940
Those weapons take time to load!

09:10.940 --> 09:13.120
Now's your chance! Attack!

09:22.510 --> 09:25.270
Hey, don't get too crazy, guys!

09:25.270 --> 09:27.890
There's more work for you to do!

09:29.420 --> 09:31.440
Hang in there, Fiorentina!

09:31.440 --> 09:32.720
You mustn't die!

09:33.590 --> 09:35.130
Cefiro-sama...

09:35.580 --> 09:41.030
I'm sorry for failing you so many times.

09:41.030 --> 09:43.500
Don't say that! I'll patch you up right now!

09:44.720 --> 09:46.030
Fiorentina!

09:56.000 --> 09:57.340
Stand fast!

09:57.340 --> 09:59.620
We can't let them get through!

10:23.440 --> 10:24.400
You're not getting away!

10:24.400 --> 10:25.640
Wait!

10:26.080 --> 10:28.280
Please, calm your anger!

10:28.280 --> 10:32.490
I have something to ask 
of you and the orcs.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.860
Please, remain calm!

10:34.230 --> 10:36.550
No. Move.

10:36.550 --> 10:39.570
I beg you... Please!

10:39.950 --> 10:41.950
These orders come from Ike-sama.

10:42.410 --> 10:43.530
Please...

10:43.940 --> 10:44.890
Ike...

10:45.600 --> 10:47.500
I'm sorry to interrupt, but...

10:47.950 --> 10:50.310
Fiorentina isn't dead yet!

10:50.310 --> 10:52.370
I want to get her treatment 
as soon as possible!

10:52.370 --> 10:55.330
So please, carry out the rest of the mission!

11:02.000 --> 11:04.430
What? Invaders inside the walls?

11:04.700 --> 11:05.970
Impossible!

11:05.970 --> 11:08.950
The watchmen said nothing!

11:08.950 --> 11:11.230
They came out of nowhere!

11:11.230 --> 11:13.650
They just appeared from thin air.

11:13.650 --> 11:15.630
Thin air?

11:15.630 --> 11:16.850
Magic.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.570
That's...

11:22.040 --> 11:23.530
<i>No...</i>

11:29.370 --> 11:31.070
Destroy them!

11:49.310 --> 11:51.020
It's time.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.690
Okay, it was a success!

12:00.000 --> 12:01.050
Gunther-sama!

12:01.050 --> 12:03.660
Yes! Begin the mission!

12:12.380 --> 12:14.350
Time to get out of here, guys!

12:14.350 --> 12:16.610
If you don't hurry, 
you'll be caught in the blasts!

12:16.610 --> 12:18.720
Escape through the gaps in the walls!

12:18.720 --> 12:19.670
Hurry!

12:22.690 --> 12:25.110
Wh-What are those?

12:25.640 --> 12:27.600
A new enemy weapon?

12:27.600 --> 12:29.200
All forces, fall back!

12:29.630 --> 12:31.060
Fall back to the main gate!

12:31.060 --> 12:32.010
Hurry!

12:32.010 --> 12:32.810
Yes, sir!

12:53.940 --> 12:55.790
All forces, advance!

12:56.310 --> 12:57.700
Drive them from their holes!

13:07.890 --> 13:09.930
Reporting, general!

13:09.930 --> 13:11.090
What is it?

13:11.090 --> 13:12.400
An enemy attack!

13:12.400 --> 13:14.330
The enemy's launched a full-out attack!

13:14.330 --> 13:18.220
What? What do we do, General?

13:18.220 --> 13:20.910
They won't even let us 
establish a bridgehead.

13:21.350 --> 13:22.790
They're not taking any chances.

13:24.000 --> 13:26.050
All forces are to immediately retreat.

13:27.120 --> 13:28.560
Did you hear me?

13:28.560 --> 13:29.740
O-Of course!

13:30.350 --> 13:31.670
All forces, retreat!

13:31.770 --> 13:32.990
All forces, retreat!

13:32.990 --> 13:34.640
All forces, retreat!

13:34.640 --> 13:37.040
Ike, commander of the Undying Brigade...

13:37.040 --> 13:38.400
I'll remember your name.

13:59.830 --> 14:01.230
Here you go!

14:02.450 --> 14:06.190
Hey, why are there humans inside the castle?

14:06.430 --> 14:09.450
They're Ike's forces.

14:09.450 --> 14:10.660
The humans?

14:10.960 --> 14:12.880
Is that true, Ike?

14:12.880 --> 14:14.120
Yes, it's true.

14:14.120 --> 14:16.560
Citizen troops from Ivalias.

14:16.560 --> 14:21.330
It's thanks to them that 
I'm talking to you right now.

14:21.650 --> 14:27.120
The humans saved us by using 
the guns the dwarves made.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.700
That's right.

14:30.700 --> 14:31.680
Got it?

14:34.170 --> 14:37.600
By the way, how are your wounds, Fiorentina?

14:37.860 --> 14:39.330
I'm fine.

14:39.330 --> 14:41.560
It will take a bigger wound 
than this to kill me.

14:41.560 --> 14:45.070
I put you through a lot, Fiorentina.

14:45.070 --> 14:46.780
No, not at all.

14:46.780 --> 14:50.650
I can't believe all this 
happened while we were gone.

14:50.650 --> 14:51.740
Yeah.

14:52.070 --> 14:54.210
Don't worry about it, you three.

14:54.210 --> 14:57.200
I'm the one who sent you to 
fight those other battles.

14:57.990 --> 14:59.570
Ike-sama!

15:00.440 --> 15:02.380
A Red Dragon Messenger sent this!

15:02.880 --> 15:04.070
What?

15:04.070 --> 15:06.000
Where is this messenger?

15:06.000 --> 15:08.800
I-I have them waiting at the castle gate...

15:08.800 --> 15:11.310
Okay, let's rip the bastard apart!

15:11.310 --> 15:12.990
Now, now. Wait.

15:12.990 --> 15:14.760
First, we'll read the letter.

15:17.340 --> 15:20.940
<i>To my dear commander of the Undying Brigade.</i>

15:21.520 --> 15:25.970
<i>During my last battle with your forces,</i>

15:25.970 --> 15:30.900
<i>I was defeated by your cunning 
plans and quick-thinking tactics.</i>

15:31.380 --> 15:35.510
<i>I felt compelled to put pen to paper to 
give you the praise I feel you deserve.</i>

15:36.010 --> 15:39.350
<i>I hope that, if heaven wills it, 
we may fight again once more,</i>

15:39.350 --> 15:40.830
<i>and wish you the best of health until then.</i>

15:41.820 --> 15:44.310
<i>E Rudle, of the Red Dragon Division.</i>

15:47.100 --> 15:51.760
It seems this E Rudle is 
quite the romanticist.

15:52.080 --> 15:56.690
But that romanticist lured me into a trap,

15:56.690 --> 15:59.120
and I lost many of my men.

15:59.620 --> 16:00.980
The pain is unbearable.

16:00.980 --> 16:03.940
Luck on the battlefield often 
switches between sides.

16:04.250 --> 16:05.650
There's nothing to be done about it.

16:06.630 --> 16:10.360
And this E Rudle...

16:10.360 --> 16:13.000
The way he trapped you,

16:13.000 --> 16:15.340
the way he led his forces during the siege,

16:15.340 --> 16:19.140
the speed with which he withdrew 
when he knew he couldn't win...

16:19.140 --> 16:22.500
All while keeping his main force reserved.

16:23.490 --> 16:25.890
Without the dwarves' new weapon,

16:25.890 --> 16:27.650
I'm not sure if we would have won the battle.

16:30.090 --> 16:33.480
So, what did it say?

16:33.480 --> 16:37.550
Um... "I won't lose next time. 
Just you wait." Something like that.

16:37.550 --> 16:41.470
Okay, so it's safe to 
rip apart the messenger!

16:41.470 --> 16:42.100
No.

16:42.100 --> 16:45.120
I'm going to write a response, 
so I'd prefer you didn't.

16:45.120 --> 16:48.480
Write down that the next time 
I see him, I'll rip him apart.

16:48.780 --> 16:50.690
He's such a brute.

16:51.180 --> 16:54.890
To E Rudle, commander of 
the Red Dragon Division.

16:55.420 --> 17:00.680
Your words honor me far more than I deserve.

17:00.680 --> 17:06.090
For my part, seeing the speed with which you 
reacted to the tides of battle left me in awe.

17:06.090 --> 17:10.000
As for your wish to meet 
again on the field of battle,

17:10.000 --> 17:15.590
I would prefer to meet you somewhere else.

17:15.590 --> 17:19.080
Sincerely, Ike.

17:20.070 --> 17:21.460
Give this to the messenger.

17:21.460 --> 17:22.780
Understood.

17:26.120 --> 17:28.220
Another success for you.

17:28.220 --> 17:28.980
Thank you.

17:29.230 --> 17:32.940
Did you need to come save me, though?

17:33.190 --> 17:35.470
The Demon Lord ordered me to.

17:35.940 --> 17:37.410
And you didn't refuse?

17:39.380 --> 17:42.000
I had no reason to.

17:45.450 --> 17:48.120
Well, I'm sure.

17:48.120 --> 17:51.660
I was the one who changed your diapers, even.

17:51.660 --> 17:53.090
We've known each other for a long time.

17:53.430 --> 17:54.830
I'm sure you couldn't refuse.

17:55.330 --> 17:56.550
Diapers?

18:08.800 --> 18:09.810
Demon Lord!

18:11.520 --> 18:16.060
M-Miss, this is no place for you.

18:16.060 --> 18:17.780
Go play somewhere else.

18:19.040 --> 18:21.420
Ignorance is a terrifying thing.

18:23.670 --> 18:25.500
Get out of here, Jiron!

18:26.110 --> 18:27.430
Just go!

18:28.000 --> 18:29.960
Demon Lord, I'm terribly sorry!

18:30.490 --> 18:31.420
De—

18:31.670 --> 18:33.630
This is Dairokuten-sama, the Demon Lord!

18:35.370 --> 18:40.320
B-But the Demon Lord has nine 
heads and they each have a crown,

18:40.320 --> 18:44.100
and he has six limbs and they've all 
got claws, and he's got three tails...

18:44.100 --> 18:45.330
I'm so sorry.

18:45.330 --> 18:49.230
This is my fault as the 
one in charge of him.

18:49.230 --> 18:50.730
It's fine.

18:50.730 --> 18:53.820
Only a few demons know my face.

18:54.100 --> 18:59.240
And you were just as confused when 
you saw me for the first time.

19:00.010 --> 19:03.370
<i>This girl is the Demon Lord?!</i>

19:05.950 --> 19:08.370
Oh, I remember!

19:08.370 --> 19:10.480
This is the girl, Ike-sama!

19:10.480 --> 19:14.020
The one who saved Ivalias all on her own!

19:14.720 --> 19:16.210
Oh, right.

19:16.210 --> 19:18.920
That would be easy if she was the demon lord.

19:20.830 --> 19:22.430
S-Sorry!

19:22.880 --> 19:25.410
I apologize once more!

19:25.410 --> 19:27.120
Please forgive him!

19:27.850 --> 19:30.950
Nine heads, six limbs...

19:30.950 --> 19:34.560
Is that how my men see me?

19:35.330 --> 19:37.380
I can understand why!

19:43.940 --> 19:45.330
I'm so dead.

19:46.080 --> 19:47.320
Cefiro...

19:47.320 --> 19:48.300
Yes?

19:48.300 --> 19:50.290
Are your wounds healed?

19:52.090 --> 19:53.500
Yes, thank you.

19:53.860 --> 19:54.940
I see.

19:55.470 --> 19:58.960
You did well in this battle.

19:59.250 --> 20:05.180
No, without my mistake, Alesta would 
never have fallen to the enemy.

20:05.560 --> 20:09.890
But without your efforts, the reinforcements 
wouldn't have arrived in time.

20:10.400 --> 20:15.860
That's why the Undying Brigade was able to 
defeat the Red Dragon Division, as I see it.

20:17.120 --> 20:17.820
Now...

20:17.820 --> 20:20.280
Gamos, leader of the Troll Brigade.

20:20.280 --> 20:22.300
Beio, leader of the Werewolf Brigade.

20:22.780 --> 20:25.250
Kushana, leader of the Fanged Beast Brigade.

20:25.740 --> 20:28.790
Fiorentina, Alchemist.

20:28.790 --> 20:32.290
And Ike, leader of the Undying Brigade...

20:32.810 --> 20:37.250
The 7th Corps has done 
splendidly during this war.

20:37.540 --> 20:42.220
All of you fought well, from your 
commanders to the lowliest soldier.

20:42.500 --> 20:45.680
And the ones who achieved the most glory of all

20:45.680 --> 20:47.800
are the Undying Brigade 
and their commander, Ike.

20:49.040 --> 20:52.700
Your deeds are worthy of great praise.

20:53.330 --> 20:54.800
Well done.

20:54.800 --> 20:56.850
Your words honor me greatly.

20:57.610 --> 21:00.320
<i>Huh? Didn't this happen before?</i>

21:00.320 --> 21:06.280
Ike, you're not someone who can be 
left in charge of a single brigade.

21:07.080 --> 21:08.240
Therefore...

21:08.510 --> 21:13.200
I am appointing you 
commander of the 8th Corps.

22:55.960 --> 22:57.900
All forces, advance!

22:57.900 --> 23:00.100
<i>The magician's name was Ike.</i>

23:00.410 --> 23:01.960
<i>He served in the Demon Lord's army,</i>

23:01.960 --> 23:06.220
<i>and was the grandson of 
Romberg, the master magician.</i>

23:07.780 --> 23:13.240
<i>One day, he would go on to bring many 
races together and unite the kingdoms,</i>

23:13.240 --> 23:15.750
<i>bringing peace to the world.</i>

23:20.380 --> 23:26.500
<i>There are rumors that he 
was a human, not a demon.</i>

23:26.810 --> 23:29.940
<i>But there are no records left 
that would reveal the truth.</i>
